<HelpTab>
    <FluentText>
        <a href="/manage/onboarding">Onboarding</a> sets up the welcome email new staff get when you register
        them, alongside the link to set their password.
    </FluentText>

    <HelpSection Title="Setting up the welcome email">
        <ol>
            <li>Turn on <strong>Send a welcome email when a new user is created</strong>.</li>
            <li>Write the <strong>Email subject</strong> and <strong>Email body</strong>.</li>
            <li>To send the same files to every new starter, such as a staff handbook, turn on <strong>Attach standing
                documents to the welcome email</strong> and add them under <strong>Standing attachments</strong>.
                Adding attachments needs the Admin or CanManageFiles role.</li>
        </ol>
        <FluentText>
            Turn on <strong>Configure separately per location</strong> to give each location its own email, then
            choose the <strong>Location</strong> to edit. When registering someone, you can still change the
            email for just that person.
        </FluentText>
    </HelpSection>
</HelpTab>
